 "notes": "TCNSeqNetwork(input 6, output 2, kernel_size=3, channels=[32,64,128,256,72,36] from config/temporal_model_defaults.json, dropout=0.2 default). Six TemporalBlocks with dilation 2**i, causal padding (k-1)*d + Chomp1d, weight_norm Conv1d (params registered as bias, weight_g (C,1,1), weight_v (C,Cin,k)), PReLU(1) x3 per block, 1x1 downsample when Cin!=C; then Dropout(0.2) + Conv1d(36,2,1). Receptive field 253 frames. Input batch-first (B,T,6), output per-frame (B,T,2). The paper text lists channels [16,32,64,128,72,36] (see paper_channels_variant); the released code/config uses [32,64,128,256,72,36].",
